.TH SHAIRPORT 1 "July 2025" "HiFiBerry" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shairport \- AirPlay 1 compatible audio receiver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shairport
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B shairport
is an AirPlay 1 compatible audio receiver that allows iOS and macOS devices to stream audio to this device. This is the legacy AirPlay 1 version for compatibility with older devices.
.SH OPTIONS
For a complete list of options, see the shairport-sync(1) manual page.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/shairport-sync.conf
Main configuration file
.TP
.I /var/lib/shairport/shairport-sync.conf
Runtime configuration file
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR shairport-airplay2 (1),
.BR start-shairport (1),
.BR shairport-sync (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Original shairport-sync by Mike Brady. AirPlay 1 version packaged by HiFiBerry.
